28
00:06:09,961 --> 00:06:12,501
Well, I'm sure you're busy, so I'll make it quick.

29
00:06:12,801 --> 00:06:13,841
Listen carefully.

30
00:06:14,061 --> 00:06:19,361
If you remember that map Pauly drew, you might notice there's no path from the courthouse to the gates of justice.

31
00:06:19,601 --> 00:06:22,701
That's been bothering me, but I was afraid to ask about it.

32
00:06:22,981 --> 00:06:24,101
