36
00:06:28,541 --> 00:06:31,361
Now there's a lever on the top floor of each of those towers.

37
00:06:31,601 --> 00:06:38,001
If you folks can get in there and pull both of them, a drawbridge will come down from the courthouse to the gates of justice.

38
00:06:38,301 --> 00:06:38,701
Whoa!

39
00:06:39,061 --> 00:06:41,061
