196
00:13:00,241 --> 00:13:02,021
Those are devil fruits, aren't they?

197
00:13:05,041 --> 00:13:05,541
Yo-yo!

198
00:13:05,541 --> 00:13:06,041
Oy!

199
00:13:06,341 --> 00:13:06,741
My!

200
00:13:09,741 --> 00:13:11,741
What a surprise!

201
00:13:13,421 --> 00:13:14,361
Cha-ba-ba!

202
00:13:15,301 --> 00:13:17,421
I've never seen one in person before!

203
00:13:17,481 --> 00:13:19,441
It's my first time as well!

204
00:13:19,681 --> 00:13:20,041
Ah!

205
00:13:20,401 --> 00:13:21,321
Stay away!

206
00:13:21,601 --> 00:13:23,341
Don't let those things near me!

207
00:13:23,821 --> 00:13:24,721
You ate one too.

208
00:13:24,941 --> 00:13:25,681
What's your problem?

209
00:13:26,101 --> 00:13:26,761
Why the fuss?

210
00:13:26,841 --> 00:13:27,121
What?

211
00:13:27,481 --> 00:13:28,381
Haven't you heard?

212
00:13:28,381 --> 00:13:32,901
The reason they're called devil fruits is because the people who eat them have a little devil

213
00:13:32,901 --> 00:13:34,121
living inside their bodies.

214
00:13:34,481 --> 00:13:35,221
Just think.

215
00:13:35,221 --> 00:13:40,161
If I get too close to one of those things, the devil inside me might pop out and start fighting

216
00:13:40,161 --> 00:13:41,421
with the devil inside the fruit!

217
00:13:41,681 --> 00:13:44,341
If that happens, my whole body will be blown to bits!

218
00:13:44,341 --> 00:13:46,221
You're kidding me.

219
00:13:46,861 --> 00:13:47,241
Huh.

220
00:13:47,521 --> 00:13:47,821
Hmm.

221
00:13:48,121 --> 00:13:49,041
That's nonsense.

222
00:13:49,681 --> 00:13:53,181
You're a member of an intelligence agency, and you believe that?

223
00:13:53,421 --> 00:13:54,241
What a shame.

224
00:13:54,241 --> 00:13:58,921
The condition for the transfer of devil fruit powers has been confirmed by scientists on

225
00:13:58,921 --> 00:14:01,001
the Grand Line for quite some time.

226
00:14:01,241 --> 00:14:05,561
The condition you're talking about only happens when someone eats two devil fruits.

227
00:14:05,861 --> 00:14:09,101
I don't know if devils are involved, but their bodies do burst apart.

228
00:14:09,261 --> 00:14:10,381
The price for greed.

229
00:14:10,641 --> 00:14:11,341
What fools.

230
00:14:11,781 --> 00:14:15,901
If you think about the risk that comes with eating one fruit, you can only imagine what

231
00:14:15,901 --> 00:14:19,401
kind of disaster you might bring upon yourself by eating two of them.

232
00:14:19,861 --> 00:14:20,461
Huh.

233
00:14:20,461 --> 00:14:23,001
So that's how it works.

234
00:14:23,461 --> 00:14:24,741
Still, I'm surprised.

235
00:14:24,881 --> 00:14:26,401
I can't believe you got two of these.

236
00:14:26,581 --> 00:14:27,681
Pretty impressive, Chief.

237
00:14:28,121 --> 00:14:29,041
How'd you pull that one?

238
00:14:29,461 --> 00:14:32,121
Let's just say I have connections, how's that?

239
00:14:32,321 --> 00:14:34,081
At any rate, best of luck.

240
00:14:35,141 --> 00:14:36,701
That's right, CP-9.

241
00:14:36,881 --> 00:14:38,561
Grow stronger and stronger.

242
00:14:39,581 --> 00:14:42,121
As always, there is a certain risk involved.

243
00:14:42,321 --> 00:14:44,961
We don't know what kind of devils reside in those fruits.

244
00:14:45,381 --> 00:14:47,781
I've never seen a fruit like this in any reference book.

245
00:14:47,781 --> 00:14:50,661
You can feel a strange power coming from them.

246
00:14:51,001 --> 00:14:52,241
A heaviness in the air.

247
00:14:52,561 --> 00:14:54,021
It's like they're from a different world.

248
00:14:54,481 --> 00:14:56,001
That's what everyone says.

249
00:14:56,841 --> 00:15:00,601
I've been told that you only learn the name of the fruit once you absorb its powers.

250
00:15:01,021 --> 00:15:03,761
But there's no guessing what kind of ability you'll gain.

251
00:15:03,761 --> 00:15:07,041
Well, there's no denying that there's a risk involved.

252
00:15:07,401 --> 00:15:08,921
The wrong power could ruin your life.

253
00:15:09,101 --> 00:15:11,481
And either way, you'll no longer be able to swim.

254
00:15:12,641 --> 00:15:15,821
It's not an issue of what power you get, but how you use it.

255
00:15:16,381 --> 00:15:18,481
No matter what, you won't get weaker.

256
00:15:18,801 --> 00:15:21,741
And as for being unable to swim, it's hardly a problem.

257
00:15:22,021 --> 00:15:24,961
It's a rare treasure of the thousands who search for them.

258
00:15:25,441 --> 00:15:28,961
I'm sure most end up empty-handed or dead by the end of their journey.

259
00:15:28,961 --> 00:15:31,101
Just try it already.

260
00:15:31,501 --> 00:15:32,681
It'll be interesting.

261
00:15:34,021 --> 00:15:34,941
Don't do it!

262
00:15:35,121 --> 00:15:35,861
Are you crazy?

263
00:15:36,301 --> 00:15:37,281
That thing's evil!

264
00:15:37,541 --> 00:15:39,261
Also, they taste like crap, I tell you!

265
00:15:39,681 --> 00:15:40,201
Crap!

266
00:15:40,341 --> 00:15:41,141
Yeah, right.

267
00:15:41,281 --> 00:15:42,081
He's jealous!

268
00:15:42,361 --> 00:15:44,801
He doesn't want them getting stronger, Chabba-Bah!

269
00:15:44,961 --> 00:15:45,521
Shame!

270
00:15:46,021 --> 00:15:48,461
You should know, Chabbera,

271
00:15:48,581 --> 00:15:52,741
that envy and resentment are a man's downfall!

272
00:15:53,821 --> 00:15:55,041
Yo-yo-y!

273
00:15:55,041 --> 00:15:57,241
Hey! Shut up!

274
00:15:58,081 --> 00:15:59,361
Come on, just stop!

275
00:15:59,601 --> 00:16:00,441
Think about this!

276
00:16:00,901 --> 00:16:03,301
If you sell these things, you could make millions!

277
00:16:03,621 --> 00:16:06,481
But one bite and you'll be cursed for the rest of your life!

278
00:16:16,481 --> 00:16:16,921
